 <h2 class="section-title">Three ways to send a referral.</h2>
 <p class="lead">Choose whichever fits your workflow. All three reach the same clinical intake team.</p>
 <div class="grid grid--3 mt-6">
 <div class="card"><h3>Online</h3><p>Submit a secure referral form at coreflowrx.com/refer, hosted by Formstack under a signed BAA for HIPAA-compliant intake. We acknowledge receipt promptly.</p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="refer.html">Submit Online →</a></div>
 <div class="card"><h3>Fax</h3><p>Download our referral cover sheet and fax to <strong>{{ site.fax }}</strong>. Include current orders, diagnosis, and insurance information.</p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="coreflow-fax-cover-sheet.pdf" download>Download Cover Sheet →</a></div>
 <div class="card"><h3>Phone</h3><p><strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong><br>{{ site.hours }}<br>For urgent or time-sensitive referrals.</p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">Call now →</a></div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

