 <h2 class="section-title">The CoreFlow Commitment.</h2>
 <p class="lead">Three things we're built to do well.</p>
 <div class="guarantee mt-6">
 <div class="guarantee__item"><h3>Easy to refer</h3><p>One streamlined referral, three ways to send it. We acknowledge it promptly and clear insurance and prior auth before it reaches your desk.</p></div>
 <div class="guarantee__item"><h3>Speed to service</h3><p>We don't sit on referrals. We move fast on authorizations and offer the earliest appointment we can once coverage clears. Fast when they want it, flexible when they don't.</p></div>
 <div class="guarantee__item"><h3>We close the loop</h3><p>After every infusion, the nursing note comes back to your office: what was given, how your patient tolerated it, and the follow-up plan. You never have to chase us.</p></div>
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

